"usage_hint"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "RH_Screenwriter", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Screenwriter"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [397.45391845703125, 632.2974853515625], "pos": [2129.274169921875, 726.51318359375], "widgets_values": ["### Global Metadata\nGrounded folk-pop in C major at 90 BPM with 4/4 time, featuring acoustic guitar, piano, and understated drums to convey a hopeful mood for a 180-second duration. The arrangement avoids blues, jazz, metal, or orchestral bombast, focusing on a warm, grounded narrative sound.\n\n### Vocal Details\nThe lead vocal is a warm male vocal that delivers the lyrics with an authentic, storytelling tone throughout the song. No female backing vocals or additional singers are included, maintaining a consistent solo male presence from start to finish.\n\n### Arrangement\nThe song begins directly with Verse 1 using sparse acoustic guitar, building into the hopeful Chorus with added piano and light percussion. Verse 2 and the Pre-Chorus introduce subtle bass and rhythmic density before the second Chorus, leading to an emotional Bridge that strips back slightly before the final Chorus and a gentle Outro fade."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 78, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [70], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [390.8931579589844, 441.8373107910156], "pos": [39.749691009521484, 794.6573486328125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [71], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [395.9524841308594, 430.7067565917969], "pos": [491.9969177246094, 797.63330078125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [476.72320556640625, 680.6190185546875], "pos": [1592.5443115234375, 698.816162109375], "widgets_values": ["[Verse 1]\n清晨的闹钟响了一遍又一遍\n拥挤的地铁里脚步匆匆无边\n手握咖啡杯眼里却满是疲倦\n心底的梦想还在燃烧着火焰\n\n[Chorus]\n打工人的路上有汗水也有光\n平凡的双手创造不平凡的光芒\n日复一日拼搏迎着希望的光\n我们是生活的主角不曾退场\n\n[Verse 2]\n办公桌旁的电脑不停地闪烁\n加班的夜晚星空也没来诉说\n疲惫的身体却仍然在坚持着\n心底的希望驱散所有的失落\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n每一份努力都值得被记住\n每一次跌倒都是成长的脚步\n生活的压力让我变得更坚固\n打工人的心中梦想永不落幕\n\n[Chorus]\n打工人的路上有汗水也有光\n平凡的双手创造不平凡的光芒\n日复一日拼搏迎着希望的光\n我们是生活的主角不曾退场\n\n[Bridge]\n总有一天梦想会绽放光辉\n付出的每一刻都值得去回味\n阳光洒满前路不再是灰黑\n打工人的歌声响彻心扉\n\n[Outro]\n清晨的闹钟响了一遍又一遍\n生活的脚步从未停下向前\n心底的梦想依旧燃烧火焰\n打工人的歌声陪伴每一天"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 74, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [41, 45], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}, {"name": "seconds", "links": [32], "label": "seconds", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "seconds"}], "size": [500, 750], "pos": [1657.4351806640625, -180.30604553222656], "widgets_values": ["Global Metadata: A Mandopop / C-pop guofeng ballad in the East Asian ballad & heritage pop family, with Chinese traditional instruments over modern cinematic-pop production; slow, breathing four-four around 68-76 BPM, gentle half-time in the verses and more motion in the choruses. The arc moves from solitary snowbound introspection through gathering urgency, warm resolute devotion, fragile bridge reflection, to a long tender final peak and a still quiet outro. The mix is wide and polished: bright plucked guzheng and breathy dizi above a warm rounded low end, spacious verses, dense gently compressed choruses, a bare bridge, an expansive final chorus, with tasteful reverbs and subtle reverse-swell transitions.\n\nVocal Details: A single female lead with a clear, crystalline, slightly breathy tone, warm in the low register and glowing on top, vibrato widening on long notes. Delivery is soft and narrative in the verses, builds through the pre-chorus, soars in the chorus with sustained belt, near-whisper in the bridge, and a long held note in the final chorus. Layered self-harmonies in parallel thirds and octaves widen the choruses, and a distant echoing backing voice floats in the outro; effects stay restrained, plate reverb, a subtle dotted delay on phrase tails, light compression.\n\nArrangement: Built around guzheng, dizi, piano and strings in one continuous arch: intro is solo guzheng over a low piano pedal with wind chimes and a faint pad, no percussion; verse one keeps the guzheng as the harmonic and melodic skeleton with warm piano, subtle bass, and a distant dizi line rising near the end; pre-chorus one builds over a swelling pad with reverse-cymbal swell while the groove settles on kick and finger-cymbals; the chorus arrives in full band - kick-and-snare, hi-hats, deep electric bass, string ensemble, guzheng glissandos, dizi ornaments and layered vocals; verse two recedes to piano arpeggios and muted guzheng over brush drum and string bed; the instrumental carries guzheng and dizi call-and-response over piano and strings with a long drum roll crescendo; the bridge strips to a single guzheng note and whisper-close voice in silence; the final chorus opens widest - upper-octave strings, stacked lines and a long held note - and the outro dissolves on the opening guzheng motif, a breath of dizi, one warm piano chord and fading wind chimes.", "[Intro]\n（古筝泛音 · 雪落声 · 一盏残灯）\n\n[Verse 1]\n雪满长安 一更又一更\n灯下研墨 写不完你的名\n一句心事 写到心思停\n落款处 只落一盏等\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n月过寒窗 不肯分明\n隔着千山 谁替我传声\n\n[Chorus]\n借一轮月色 照你归程\n我点着一盏灯 守着孤城\n千里风雪 都是我的回声\n雪落一整夜 我醒着在等\n\n[Verse 2]\n石桥青苔 又落一层\n旧笛悬梁 冻到不肯醒\n夜深偏长 灯花结成影\n你名字落地 像雪压住长安的声\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n呵出暖雾 窗上画你的名\n怕雪停以后 认不出这盏灯\n\n[Chorus]\n借一城的月光 引你归程\n我用一生 暖你这一盏灯\n风雪来回 就作我的歌声\n你回来 让雪落得安静\n\n[Instrumental]\n（古筝 · 竹笛 对答 · 雪落声）\n\n[Bridge]\n那年大雪 封冷了寒冬\n我们在两扇窗前 各守一盏灯\n若来世再有一盏 等你的灯\n我定比雪 更早亮到三更\n\n[Final Chorus]\n借一生的月色 唤你归程\n你门前的长明 便是我这一盏灯\n纵使大雪漫过 千山万城\n长安的灯海 都写着你的名\n\n[Outro]\n雪停了\n灯还亮着\n我还在城中\n等你回程", 222, "fixed", 300, 1.5, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 34, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "link": 80, "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 76, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 35, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_duration"}, "name": "max_duration", "link": 82, "label": "max_duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "max_duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "MiniMaxMusic3TextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true, "top_k": true, "caption": true, "lyrics": true, "max_duration": true,